  "download_disabled": false,
  "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">This is the Global Dam Watch (GDW) database of river barriers and reservoirs, version 1.0. The database development is fully described in Lehner et al. 2024 (see DOI-link in References below).</p><p dir=\"ltr\">There are 2 zip files (one in Geodatabase format and one in Shapefile format):</p><ul><li>\"GDW_v1_0_gdb.zip\" contains both river barriers (points) and reservoirs (polygons) including all attribute information, in Geodatabase format</li><li>\"GDW_v1_0_shp.zip\" contains both river barriers (points) and reservoirs (polygons) including all attribute information, in Shapefile format; additionally there is a comma delimited text file containing all barrier attributes</li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\">Each of the zip-files contains a Technical Documentation (GDW_TechDoc_v1_0.pdf) which provides additional information. The GDW database is maintained by the Global Dam Watch initiative, see <a href=\"https://www.globaldamwatch.org\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.globaldamwatch.org</a>.</p>",
